        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marcia Wallace, Edna Krabappel, Bart Simpson, Ned Flanders\n- Works: The Bob Newhart Show, The Simpsons\n- Roles: Carol Kester, elementary school teacher, 4th grade teacher, wife\n- Places: Springfield Elementary School\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1970s, Marcia Wallace played receptionist Carol Kester on the sitcom The Bob Newhart Show.\n- In 1992, Marcia Wallace won an Emmy for voicing Edna Krabappel on the animated series The Simpsons.\n- Edna Krabappel is an elementary school teacher on The Simpsons.\n- Edna Krabappel teaches Bart Simpson's 4th grade class at Springfield Elementary School.\n- In later seasons of The Simpsons, Edna Krabappel is Ned Flanders's wife.",
